/****************************************************************************
 * app/velafit_ai/render/velafit_font_cjk.c
 *
 * 16x16 1bpp CJK glyph table for real coach advice on the product LCD.
 *
 * Charset: GB2312 symbol zones 1-9 plus level-1 hanzi zones 16-55
 * (4437 glyphs).  Font: Noto Sans SC Regular (SIL OFL 1.1), rasterized at
 * 15 px, threshold 96, cropped to the common 16-row baseline window.
 * Glyphs are sorted by Unicode codepoint; the lookup is a binary search.
 *
 * Flash cost: 141984 bytes of glyph bitmap + 8874 bytes of codepoint index.
 * RAM cost: 0 (const data only).  ASCII stays on the existing 5x7 font.
 * Missing codepoints render as a hollow box and are counted by the caller.
 ****************************************************************************/

